{
  "key": 5171,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "EternaCityEastHouse_Text_EternaCameToBeLongAgo",
      "en_US": [
        "Eterna came to be long ago in honor\n",
        "of ancient Pokémon.\r",
        "Though many things have changed,\n",
        "what is important has not.\r",
        "I hope it remains that way forever\n",
        "more..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vestigion fut bâtie il y a longtemps\n",
        "en l’honneur des anciens Pokémon.\r",
        "Le temps passe, le monde tourne et\n",
        "tout change, sauf le plus important.\r",
        "J’espère qu’il en sera toujours ainsi..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityEastHouse_Text_HaveYouSeenStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you seen the Pokémon statue?\r",
        "When I was a wee child, it used to be\n",
        "the centerpiece of many festivals..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "As-tu vu la statue de Pokémon?\r",
        "Quand j’étais petite, c’était la pièce\n",
        "centrale de nombreux festivals..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityEastHouse_Text_WantToKnowWhatPlateSaid",
      "en_US": [
        "Sheesh! \n",
        "What’s the world coming to?!\r",
        "Someone ripped off the descriptive\n",
        "plate from the Pokémon statue!\r",
        "Now no one can read the inscription!\n",
        "Why would someone do that?\f",
        "Actually, want to know what it said?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bigre!\n",
        "Mais où va-t-on?!\r",
        "La plaque descriptive de la statue\n",
        "de Pokémon a été arrachée!\r",
        "Maintenant, plus personne ne peut lire\n",
        "les inscriptions!\r",
        "Qui a bien pu faire ça? Au fait, tu veux\n",
        "savoir ce qu’elles disaient?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityEastHouse_Text_FirstInscriptionLikeThisHearOther",
      "en_US": [
        "The first inscription went like this,\n",
        "sort of.\r",
        "“...creation of DIA...\n",
        "...giver of time...\r",
        "“In laughter, there is tears...\n",
        "And, likewise...\r",
        "“The same time flows...\n",
        "...the blessing of DIA...”\r",
        "Yikes...\n",
        "I’ve forgotten big chunks of it.\r",
        "Want to hear about the other\n",
        "inscription?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Grosso modo, la première inscription\n",
        "disait ceci:\r",
        "“... création de DIA...\n",
        "... maître du temps...\r",
        "Dans le rire, il y a les larmes...\n",
        "Et, pareillement...\r",
        "Le même temps s’écoule...\n",
        "... la bénédiction de DIA...”\r",
        "Oups...\n",
        "Je ne me rappelle pas tout.\r",
        "Tu veux savoir ce que disait l’autre\n",
        "inscription?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityEastHouse_Text_SecondInscriptionWentLikeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "The second inscription went sort of\n",
        "like this.\r",
        "“...birth of PAL...\n",
        "...creator of parallel dimensions...\r",
        "“Alive, yet not alive...\n",
        "...rifts in space...\r",
        "“To arrive in the same univer...\n",
        "...the blessing of PAL...”\r",
        "I’ve heard some people talk about\n",
        "there once being a third inscription.\r",
        "I’m kind of skeptical, though.\n",
        "I mean, think about it.\r",
        "A third Pokémon alongside those that\n",
        "control time and space?\r",
        "There couldn’t possibly be a Pokémon\n",
        "that mighty."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La deuxième inscription disait à peu\n",
        "près ceci:\r",
        "“... naissance de PAL...\n",
        "... créateur des mondes parallèles...\r",
        "Vivant et non-vivant...\n",
        "... gouffres dans l’espace...\r",
        "Arriver dans le même uni...\n",
        "... la bénédiction de PAL...”\r",
        "J’ai entendu dire qu’il y avait eu une\n",
        "troisième inscription.\r",
        "Mais j’en doute.\n",
        "C’est vrai, quoi, réfléchis.\r",
        "Un troisième Pokémon en plus de ceux\n",
        "qui contrôlent le temps et l’espace?\r",
        "Un Pokémon aussi puissant, moi je n’y\n",
        "crois pas."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityEastHouse_Text_DontFeelObligated",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, if you’re not interested, don’t\n",
        "feel obligated or anything."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu sais, si ça ne t’intéresse pas, ce\n",
        "n’est pas moi qui vais te forcer."
      ]
    }
  ]
}